<title>USA: Key Tronic names Oehlke CEO.</title>
<headline>Key Tronic names Oehlke CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Key Tronic Corp said Wednesday Jack Oehlke was promoted to chief executive officer, replacing Fred Wenninger, who is resigning to concentrate on other business interests.</p>
<p>The company said Oehlke will continue to serve in his current post as chief operating officer for the time being. It said there were no immediate plans to name a successor.</p>
</text>
